    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74847" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρεκτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεξις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>appetitive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				433b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EE</u>
				1233a38
			</span></i>, al. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀρεκτικόν</span> the
				<i>impulsive</i> or <i>conative</i> faculty, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1102b30
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ ἕτερον τὸ ὀ. καὶ φευκτικόν . .
					ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>de An.</u>
					431a13
				</span></i>
			, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. νοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>EN</u>
					1139b4
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> Hsch.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θουραίη</span>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ ἀγαθὸν -κῶς κινεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.3.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>exciting appetite,</i>
			
